\taxon{Remark}
\p{Note that this definition doesn’t say anything about #{\leq}! The word \em{greatest} in the phrase \em{greatest common divisor} should really be taken to mean \em{highest in the divisibility diagram}, not “greater than” in the usual #{\geq} sense.}



